#EXTM3U
# Manual playlist for Jellyfin / VLC / mpv.
#
# Replace <your-pc-ip> with the LAN IP or hostname of the machine running
# op25-docker, then point your player's M3U tuner (Jellyfin: Dashboard ->
# Live TV -> Tuners -> M3U Tuner) at this file.
#
# Credentials below are the default listener login (scanner / listen123).
# If you changed them in conf/listen.json, update this URL to match - or set
# icecast.listener_auth to false in conf/stream.json and drop the
# scanner:listen123@ part entirely.
#
# Tip: you don't need to keep this file up to date by hand - the web UI's
# Live tab has a "Copy Jellyfin URL" button that copies an always-current
# playlist link, e.g.
#   http://<your-pc>:8080/playlist.m3u?user=scanner&password=listen123
# (query params instead of user:pass@host - Jellyfin validates tuner URLs
# without HTTP Basic auth, so userinfo-style links fail its save check).
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Radio",OP25 Scanner
http://scanner:listen123@<your-pc-ip>:8000/primary.mp3
